# 2-qubit Grover search marking |11⟩, one iteration. The diffusion is
# rewritten with an explicit phase-flip-and-Hadamard sandwich; CZ on the
# two qubits realises the marker oracle for |11⟩.
qubits 2
H 0
H 1
# Oracle: phase-flip |11⟩
CZ 0 1
# Diffusion: H · (2|0⟩⟨0| − I) · H, where 2|0⟩⟨0| − I = -X⊗X · CZ · X⊗X · -1
# A simpler equivalent: H X⊗X CZ X⊗X H (global phase aside).
H 0
H 1
X 0
X 1
CZ 0 1
X 0
X 1
H 0
H 1
